"Ph.D. researcher working on forest fire early warning and numerical weather prediction.": "从事森林火灾早期预警与数值天气预报研究的博士研究生。",
"PROFILE": "简介",
"Bio": "个人简介",
"I am a Ph.D. researcher at the Centre of Excellence in Disaster Mitigation and Management (CoEDMM), Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee. My thesis develops an early warning system for forest fire events over the Indian Himalayan Region.": "我是 Centre of Excellence in Disaster Mitigation and Management (CoEDMM), Indian Institute of Technology Roorkee 的博士研究生。我的论文旨在为印度喜马拉雅地区的森林火灾事件建立早期预警系统。",
"The work combines numerical weather prediction models with observational and reanalysis datasets. I also work on tropical cyclones and on disasters induced by climate change.": "研究将数值天气预报模式与观测资料和再分析资料相结合。我也研究热带气旋以及气候变化引发的灾害。",
"I conduct workshops and give lectures on the WRF model, Python, R and Origin Pro at universities and colleges across India.": "我在印度各地的大学和学院讲授 WRF 模式、Python、R 和 Origin Pro 的研讨会与讲座。",
